    "BROD 3 is independently documented in the current Battlefield 6 Wiki as having the same damage, dropoff, and rate of fire as GRT-BC. Its audited chest TTK therefore matches GRT-BC at every distance.",
    "BF6 1.4.2.5 explicitly states Match Trigger no longer affects BROD 3 fully automatic fire. Match Trigger therefore cannot create a verified chest-TTK advantage.",
    "Carbine Burst Training / burst-mode attachment records currently marked assumed are excluded from VERIFIED AUTO META until their exact cadence is independently validated."
  ],
